<title>USA: Ameriana Bancorp Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Ameriana Bancorp Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW CASTLE, Ind. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited Financial Highlights</p>
<p>		 (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					3 Months Ended     Year Ended</p>
<p>					   Dec. 31	    Dec. 31</p>
<p>					 1996    1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Interest income	     $  7,355$  6,572 $ 28,567 $ 25,608</p>
<p> Interest expense		 4,322   3,823   16,705   14,368</p>
<p> Net interest income	    3,033   2,749   11,862   11,240</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses	  3	 3	 66	117</p>
<p>Net interest income after</p>
<p>  provision for loan losses   3,030   2,746   11,796   11,123</p>
<p> Other income			 736     525    2,433    2,214</p>
<p> Other expense		    2,374   2,011   10,520    8,155</p>
<p>Income before income</p>
<p>  taxes			     1,392   1,260    3,709    5,182</p>
<p> Income taxes			 496     453    1,305    1,945</p>
<p> Net income			   896     807    2,404    3,237</p>
<p> Earnings per share		 .27     .23	.72	.92</p>
<p> Weighted average shares	3,297   3,526    3,336    3,511</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 net before one-time assessment on SAIF-insured savings associations increased 10 percent to record $1.07 per share versus $0.92 per share in 1995. Net income for 1996, before $1.8 million assessment, totaled $3.5 million, compared with $3.2 million in 1995. Net income for 1996, after the assessment, was $2.4 million or $0.72 per share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
